    "title": "Potential Macon FRL exit puts Swain in bind - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lily Levin ,\n12 hours ago Swain Librarian Jeff Delfield learned through a text that Macon commissioners had voted to begin the process of leaving the Fontana Regional Library system in 2027. The June 9 decision follows in the footsteps of Jackson County. Though Jackson commissioners cited concerns about LGBTQ+ material as justification, Macon County framed the vote as a financially prudent move. Read full article\n1",
